Modified by ammonkc: port of the model-router plugin from
https://github.com/michaelzwiener/claude-mods (MIT) at commit
a2bf57cc3ff8e37a2e22106733567cfbcb843808, itself a copy by BenAI (2026-11-02)
of the Jev Model Router in cli-tool/components/mods/productivity/jev-model-router
of https://github.com/davila7/claude-code-templates, under the license above.
This copy is rewritten for Bedrock inference profile ARNs and an explicit
model lock, and drops the pane, mascot, cost tables and main loop effort routing.
